ary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5dev4\n- Not reproducible in: 4.4.1.stable.official (49a5bc7b6)\n\nI believe this bug is a regression.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev4 - macOS Sequoia (15.4.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M4 Pro (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe WorldEnvironment background and/or Camera Environment background do not work at runtime in 4.5dev4; instead of rendering either the custom color or sky, I simply get a gray background. Assuming I set the environment background via the WorldEnvironment node, the backgrounds **are** correctly visible in-editor but not at runtime.\n\np.s. Godot is amazing, and I deeply <3 all the work you folks are doing. If there is anything I can do to help here, please let me know. I'm also totally willing to dive in and fix/generate a PR for this if someone will be kind enough to mentor me (perhaps point me in the right direction).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project\n2. Create a Node3D scene \n3. Add a `WorldEnvironment` node\n4. In the `WorldEnvironment` node, create a new `Environment` and set the environment's Background mode to `Custom Color`.  Adjust the color field so it's any non-gray color, e.g., red.\n5. Add a `Camera3D` node to the scene\n6. Run the project and observe that the custom color is not visible\n---\nNotes:\n- Setting the background mode to `Sky` and then populating any kind of Sky Material (Panorama, Procedural, PhysicalSky, etc) also do not work\n- The rest of the project and node properties are all left in default values\n- I see the same behavior as above even if I remove the `WorldEnvironment` node and instead set the `Environment` directly in the Camera3D\n- I see the same behavior as above even if I use a 2D scene\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A - the bug is visible in a brand new project","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106471/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106471/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}